2); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for your time earlier. As promised, I've shared some tips below on how Qantas Business&nbsp;Rewards can help you book, organise and save on your business travel.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686C4F0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686C750" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686CC10"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686CE70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">You can also click through to our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to.html" target="_blank" title="Qantas Business Rewards How-to Guides" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686D0D0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">How-to guides</a>&nbsp;if you'd like more information on getting the most out of your membership.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686D6C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686D920" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686DDE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686E040" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks again for your time. If you have any other questions, please contact me direct on 13&nbsp;10&nbsp;85 ext. <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);">XXX</span>, or the Qantas Business Rewards Priority line 13&nbsp;74&nbsp;78.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016868550"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686EC20">See you on board soon.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686F310"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686F570" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686FA30"></font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686FB40" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001686FFE0"></font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016870CB0"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016871170" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168713D0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016871630"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016871890" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/images/QBR-laptop.jpg" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016871D40" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 285px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016872440" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016872900"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016872FF0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016873250"><td align="left" a="" class="h2 no_underline heading_color" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Turn Qantas Points into business&nbsp;flights</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168734B0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168742A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016874760"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016874A10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 285px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Whether you need to book flights, seats or bags, you can do it all using Qantas Points directly from your Qantas Business Rewards account.<span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016874C70" style="vertical-align: 1px; bottom: 0.4ex; position: relative;">~</span>&nbsp;Simply use the points in your Business Rewards account to book a Classic Flight Rewards^ seat, or Points&nbsp;Plus&nbsp;Pay - Flights.**<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168754C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000168755D0">Alternatively, you can transfer (min. 3,000) points to any Qantas Frequent Flyer account to redeem for your choice of rewards at Qantas Marketplace.<span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016875810" style="vertical-align: 1px; font-size: 10px; bottom: 0.6ex; position: relative;">†</span></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016875E00"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016876060" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr